sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Agent
    participant Obs as Observability
    participant Tool
    User->>Agent: Request
    Agent->>Obs: start_trace(agent_run)
    Agent->>Obs: start_span(classify)
    Obs-->>Agent: span context
    Agent->>Obs: end_span(completed)
    Agent->>Obs: start_span(tool.search)
    Agent->>Tool: call(arguments)
    Tool-->>Agent: result
    Agent->>Obs: event(tool_result_received)
    Agent->>Obs: end_span(completed)
    Agent->>Obs: metric(agent.run.duration_ms)
    Agent->>Obs: end_trace(completed)
    Agent-->>User: Response
